{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worknenjoy/gitpay/pulls/1642","id":5036461484,"node_id":"PR_kwDOBTWyNM8AAAABLDJNrA","html_url":"https://github.com/worknenjoy/gitpay/pull/1642","diff_url":"https://github.com/worknenjoy/gitpay/pull/1642.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/worknenjoy/gitpay/pull/1642.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worknenjoy/gitpay/issues/1642","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worknenjoy/gitpay/pulls/1642/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worknenjoy/gitpay/pulls/1642/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worknenjoy/gitpay/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worknenjoy/gitpay/issues/1642/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worknenjoy/gitpay/statuses/4a4e682fee20017dfcd88d4c99fe9b1cdbc249df","number":1642,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix: authorize and cap task payments","user":{"login":"newworldba","id":7953768,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NTM3Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7953768?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/newworldba","html_url":"https://github.com/newworldba","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newworldba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newworldba/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newworldba/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newworldba/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newworldba/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newworldba/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newworldba/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newworldba/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newworldba/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n- Require the caller to own the task before `POST /tasks/payments`.\n- Reject already-paid tasks and requests when the task has no captured paid orders.\n- Enforce a server-side funding cap and validate the requested amount.\n- Add a task-level Stripe idempotency key so retries cannot duplicate a payout.\n\n## Security impact\n\nCloses #1611.\n\nBefore, any authenticated user could name a task and supply an arbitrary transfer amount. The endpoint now verifies ownership, limits the transfer to captured funding, and prevents duplicate or unbounded Stripe transfers.\n\n## Tests\n\n- New focused API suite: 3 passing.\n- Regressions cover non-owner rejection, an amount above captured funds, and a successful owner payment with the expected Stripe idempotency key.\n- `npm run typecheck`\n- `npm run lint`: 0 errors (pre-existing warnings only)\n- Prettier checks passed.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-27T15:21:10Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T15:21:10Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"d1f0921063c2dbe3abe13e2168e28f58dbfb18fc","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"newworldba:fix-task-payment-authorization","ref":"fix-task-payment-authorization","repo":{"id":1434755150,"node_id":"R_kgDOVYSgTg","name":"gitpay","full_name":"newworldba/gitpay","owner":{"login":"newworldba","id":7953768,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NTM3Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7953768?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/newworldba","html_url":"https://github.com/newworldba","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newworldba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newworldba/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newworldba/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newworldba/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newworldba/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/newworldba/orgs","repos_u